      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "WE NEED THIS! Wears/uses and a favorited metric. Maybe lots of people have tried an avatar because it looked cool, but then no one favorited it because it's not worth using? Or maybe lots of people favorited it, but you just don't see it out in the wild so you think it's a failure.",
